{"id":18190,"name":"Allegan County","slug":"allegan-county","state":"Michigan","code":"MI","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/michigan-tax-deed-sales-property-deals-90-off/allegan-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:50:29","facts":{"taxSaleType":"Tax Deed Sale","bidProcedure":"Premium Bid","deposit":"$1,000","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date of Sale","value":"Third Tuesday in July and the first Tuesday in November"},{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Allegan County Treasurer’s Office"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Tax Sale Info"},{"label":"County Website","value":"Allegan Official Website"},{"label":"Unsold Properties","value":"You may go to a no-reserve auction; stay alert for deals."},{"label":"Video Tutorials","value":"Available on tax-sale.info"},{"label":"Accepted Forms of Payment","value":"Wire transfer, certified cashier’s checks, or credit/debit cards (additional 2.75% processing fee for credit/debit)"},{"label":"Minimum Bid","value":"Includes back taxes, penalties, fees, and other costs incurred by the county."},{"label":"Refunds","value":"All sales are final, and there are no refunds for properties purchased at auction. Exceptions for cancellations due to significant issues"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"easHLIWR6Cj7mchMXQf1OoBDri3l8EqJYNguTUSAx594VP0Gdybk2F\"><iframe title=\"Epic 40-90% Off! Real Estate Bargain Hunt - Allegan County - Michigan Tax Deed Investing\" width=\"563\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ILTgRlwSAA8?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Epic-40-90%-Off!-Real-Estate-Bargain-Hunt---Allegan-County---Michigan-Tax-Deed-Investing\">Epic 40-90% Off! Real Estate Bargain Hunt in Allegan County MI</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Ready to score big on real estate? Allegan County, Michigan, is the place for tax foreclosure sales. You can land properties at 40 to 90% off. All the action is online, with sales happening between the third Tuesday in July and the first Tuesday in November. Keep your eyes peeled for the final sale, which shakes things up with no minimum bid required.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>Head over to <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">tax-sale.info</mark></a><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\"> </mark>for all the details. Make sure to check out the video tutorials—they&#8217;re a big help. You gotta register and drop a $1,000 hold on your credit card to get in. This deposit is only if you win and don&#8217;t pay up.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>In Allegan County, bidding starts 30 days out. Come auction day, it&#8217;s go time from 10:00 a.m. to 7:00 p.m. Winners receive an email with payment and notarization instructions.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>If a property doesn&#8217;t sell, don&#8217;t walk away yet. A no-reserve auction might follow, with bids kicking off at just $100. Remember, this is your shot at getting properties back on the tax rolls and snagging a deal. So, check out <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">tax-sale.info</mark></a>, register, and win the bid!</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Details-About-Allegan-County-Tax-Deed-Sales\">Important Details for Allegan County Foreclosure Sales</h3>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Allegan-County-Courthouse.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Allegan-County-Courthouse-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Allegan-County-Courthouse-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Allegan-County-Courthouse-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Allegan-County-Courthouse-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Allegan-County-Courthouse-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Allegan-County-Courthouse.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Allegan-County-Courthouse.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Allegan-County-Courthouse-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Allegan-County-Courthouse-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Allegan-County-Courthouse-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Allegan-County-Courthouse-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Allegan-County-Courthouse-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18197 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Allegan County Courthouse\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"FAQs-About-Allegan-County-Tax-Deed-Sales\">FAQs in Allegan County Tax Sale</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What are the main types of auctions?</strong> <br>A: Allegan County holds minimum bid auctions and no-reserve auctions, all conducted online.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: What payment methods are accepted?</strong> <br>A: Wire transfer, certified cashier&#8217;s checks, or credit/debit cards (with a 2.75% processing fee).</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: How do I register for the Allegan County Tax Sale auction?</strong> <br>A: Register on <a href=\"https://www.tax-sale.info/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">tax-sale.info</mark></a> and place a $1,000 hold on your credit card.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Q: Are there refunds if I change my mind?</strong> <br>A: No, all sales are final. Refunds are only issued if the sale is cancelled due to significant issues.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Useful-Links\">Useful Links</h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.allegancounty.org/departments/treasurer-s-office\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"back